OL,3,GNEWSATraffic chaos in Perthshire
OL,4,Avillages after Google Maps glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle insisted the problem had been
OL,7,Fresolved but local residents said the
OL,8,Finaccurate information left them
OL,9,Fworried and, in some cases, unable to
OL,10,Fleave their homes.
